  "tablet.worldsfall.1": "We counted the tides. Each year they came closer.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.10": "Then nothing held.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.11": "Our children forgot our faces. They remembered our hands.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.12": "If you are reading this, you are standing on something that should have fallen.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.2": "The towers were not homes. They were ladders.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.3": "Pearls were for children first. Then for the frightened.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.4": "The grazers do not fear us. We were never hunters.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.5": "Still water drinks the light. Do not let the young swim.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.6": "We built the warden from what we loved most, so it would never leave.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.7": "The undersides are quieter. We dug there to listen for stillness.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.8": "Carry the world with you. Carry it up.",
  "tablet.worldsfall.9": "The Heart held for one breath. Everyone heard it.",
